        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "I am extremely pleased with the pedicures Kiran does! She makes the process very smooth and the results have always been satisfying.\nOn top of that, she is both an amazing listener and conversationalist. Very attentive and kind. The fact she remembers points of conversation weeks apart blows my mind and makes me appreciative!\nWould recommend!",
