      {
        "author_name": "GURLEEN KAUR",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113498006914450546282/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocISzCDupvYeGGQJPeptVlpji593xq9RWUrmiHNXrzO6L0F_nkk=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "I had a great experience at this salon with Kiran for aesthetic services and Manie for hair services. Both were professional, friendly, and attentive to detail. My nails and hair turned out exactly how I wanted, and my husband was very happy with his haircut as well. Highly recommended for both men and women!",
        "time": 1767887992,
        "translated": false
