        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "I am from out of town staying for a few months in the area and I was lucky enough to find Manie.\nI have been to him a few times now and plan to continue to go while I am staying.\nHe is quick, polite, professional and on point along with very reasonability priced.\nHe is also very accommodating on time options.\nI highly recommend him.\nKeep up the great work.",
        "time": 1767573882,
